Package: GSPip
Type: Package
Title: Genomic Selection Pipeline Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    "GSPip", "Development Team",
    email = "akohoue.f@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Description: Reads numeric, HapMap, and VCF marker data, performs auditable
    marker and sample quality control, supports several missing-genotype
    strategies including external Beagle imputation, and constructs genomic
    relationship matrices with optional marker weights. Programmatic APIs
    support training-population optimization and GBLUP evaluation with either
    'ASReml-R' or 'BGLR', with or without genotype-by-environment effects.
URL: https://FAkohoue.github.io/GSPip/,
    https://github.com/FAkohoue/GSPip
BugReports: https://github.com/FAkohoue/GSPip/issues
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    AGHmatrix,
    ASRgenomics,
    cluster,
    data.table,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    asreml,
    BGLR,
    rrBLUP,
    STPGA,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
SystemRequirements: Java (optional, for Beagle imputation)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
